{"4987170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shole Soccer", "steam_appid": 4987170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/89e28c1c7ec11ce4e28b6cebffd05be8.avif?t=1787556011\" width=700 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shole Soccer is a chaotic online soccer game with next to no rules. In this game, body control matters as much as ball control. Take the shot with a kick, stun your opponents, and slide tackle anyone coming your way. In a defensive situation, dive to block a shot — or accidentally redirect it into your own goal and feel the disappointment of your teammates.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0382cd4160e067dbc02be1c9f00c5d81.poster.avif?t=1787556011\" width=1170 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0382cd4160e067dbc02be1c9f00c5d81.webm?t=1787556011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0382cd4160e067dbc02be1c9f00c5d81.mp4?t=1787556011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/499c07bdc7a72582853500e160949b7c.avif?t=1787556011\" width=700 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your opponent dribbling the ball toward your goal? Not today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your teammate about to score and overtake you on the scoreboard? Not today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well-timed stun or slide tackle can take you far. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0c03fe22e1a252f434d6f8d5a0d47048.poster.avif?t=1787556011\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0c03fe22e1a252f434d6f8d5a0d47048.webm?t=1787556011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0c03fe22e1a252f434d6f8d5a0d47048.mp4?t=1787556011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/aa55396eb20b09ebf833fa803d097bbc.avif?t=1787556011\" width=700 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ball does exactly what it should. A perfectly aimed kick and a panicked toe-poke feel completely different — and have completely different outcomes. Chaos and glory are always just one touch away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the ball however you see fit. Use your feet, your head, pass it around or launch your athletic body into it. Just be careful with the chip kick, or you might send the ball flying over the stands and find yourself back in the middle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/b84aa96904ff9d2e180535c0374b27d9.poster.avif?t=1787556011\" width=1170 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/b84aa96904ff9d2e180535c0374b27d9.webm?t=1787556011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/b84aa96904ff9d2e180535c0374b27d9.mp4?t=1787556011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0276714b8e5fd2d7f4d0a93829a722f3.avif?t=1787556011\" width=700 height=142 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online play</strong> - take your friends to the field in 1v1, 2v2 and 3v3 matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playing with the ball </strong>- move the ball around with dribbles, headbutts, kicks, chip kicks, or simply dive your athletic body into it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show your colors</strong> - character customization with your preferred colors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice mode</strong> - for polishing your ball skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong> - play with your controller or mouse &amp; keyboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i><strong>One more match&quot; </strong></i>- Match lengths vary from short enough to convince your friends to play  one more, to longer sessions. No hydration breaks though.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the developer.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shole Soccer is developed by <strong>One For Me Games,</strong> a solo developer based in Finland, with a mission to create enjoyable experiences that leave a smile on your face.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/89e28c1c7ec11ce4e28b6cebffd05be8.avif?t=1787556011\" width=700 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shole Soccer is a chaotic online soccer game with next to no rules. In this game, body control matters as much as ball control. Take the shot with a kick, stun your opponents, and slide tackle anyone coming your way. In a defensive situation, dive to block a shot — or accidentally redirect it into your own goal and feel the disappointment of your teammates.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0382cd4160e067dbc02be1c9f00c5d81.poster.avif?t=1787556011\" width=1170 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0382cd4160e067dbc02be1c9f00c5d81.webm?t=1787556011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0382cd4160e067dbc02be1c9f00c5d81.mp4?t=1787556011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/499c07bdc7a72582853500e160949b7c.avif?t=1787556011\" width=700 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your opponent dribbling the ball toward your goal? Not today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your teammate about to score and overtake you on the scoreboard? Not today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A well-timed stun or slide tackle can take you far. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0c03fe22e1a252f434d6f8d5a0d47048.poster.avif?t=1787556011\" width=1170 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4987170/extras/0c03fe22e1a252f434d6f8d5a0d47048.webm?t=1787556011